Error [E0003]: A value dispatch needs a final `else` arm
  --> tests/ui/value_dispatch_missing_else.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     }
    |     ^
 Why: Only a table whose every arm is a pattern can prove one arm always matches; this one has a comparison or Bool arm
 Fix: Add `else -> value` so every path produces a value
